

# Override for which app's trades count toward the growth challenge.
#
# Normally leave this EMPTY: it falls back to MARKUP_APP_ID, which is the same
# value as the frontend's CLIENT_ID — the app that issues the OAuth2 token
# trades are placed under. Set it only if those two ever diverge.
#
# Whatever it resolves to must equal the `app_id` Deriv puts on a profit_table
# row, or nothing matches and the challenge sits at zero.
DERIV_TRADING_APP_ID=

# Shared secret for the hand-driven admin routes: GET /api/admin/list and
# POST/DELETE /api/admin, which write the admin allow-list. Send it as the
# X-Admin-Token header (a bearer token also works).
#
# Required: with this unset those three routes answer 503 rather than falling
# open. Nothing a customer touches depends on them, and the admin UI does not
# call them, so leaving it unset breaks no screen.
#
# Generate one with:  node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('hex'))"
ADMIN_API_TOKEN=
